#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0208 expect=skipped domain=ADLBC
#note "structure=BDS is the DECLARED tier and beats the columns (Fix #154) -> Scope.Data_Structures.Include [SUBJECT LEVEL ANALYSIS DATASET] rejects a BDS dataset before execution. ONE pin of the SLAD scope block on behalf of AD0209/AD0210/AD0367 too. ⛔⛔ THE DM BLOCK IS LOAD-BEARING AND SO IS ADLBC.SUBJID -- WITHOUT EITHER THIS FILE PINS NOTHING. Requirements.Variables.All is [SUBJID, DM.SUBJID], and RuleRunner checks variable requirements at :632 BEFORE the Scope.Data_Structures gate at :673. Until 2026-09-22 this fixture had NO DM block at all, so it skipped on DM.SUBJID being unavailable and never reached the structure gate -- and ExecutionVerdictCheck asserts no REASON for expect=skipped, so it stayed GREEN while pinning nothing. MEASURED: with the whole Scope.Data_Structures block deleted from the rule, this test still passed. Both requirement entries must be SATISFIED here so that the structure gate is the only thing left to reject the dataset."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADLBC structure=BDS
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col AVAL    type=Num
col SUBJID  type=Char
---
S1 | 01-701-1015 | ALB | 30 | 9999
---

dataset DM label=Demographics
col STUDYID type=Char
col DOMAIN  type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col SUBJID  type=Char
---
S1 | DM | 01-701-1015 | 9999
---
